{"id":"vod_bf_43890","vodId":"43890","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"约会大作战第二季","name_cn":"约会大作战第二季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第11集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-45/623c7caa94b07aae5cae8c7162bbbdcf.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《约会大作战Ⅱ》是根据日本小说家橘公司著作、つなこ（Tsunako）负责插画的轻小说《约会大作战》改编的同名电视动画的第二期作品。2013年6月22日，由AIC PLUS 制作的第一季第12话末尾宣布了该作二期制作决定的消息。动画公司由AIC PLUS 更换成Production IMS制作。原作小说作者橘公司也在第一时间发了动画二期决定的推文。伴随着空间震荡、拥有毁灭世界力量的精灵。然后，五河士道拥有封印那个普通的精灵的力量的能力。打破那样的士道的，平静健康的假日的午后，突然的爆炸声音。那是再次拉开帷幕，与精灵们的战争(约会)前奏曲(前奏曲)……。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:43:55","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandierji/第11集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:41:31.653Z"}